# Haxe JS oracle for the readonly-alias fixture.
# Run from the repository root (inside the boring devShell):
#   haxe tests/haxe/readonly-alias/oracle.hxml -js out/readonly-alias/<run>/oracle/oracle.js
# The runner appends the -js output path; the entry main() logs the five
# labeled lines that every native harness must reproduce.
-lib boring
-cp packages/compiler
-cp samples
-cp tests/haxe/readonly-alias
--macro Intercept.run(['samples', 'tests/haxe/readonly-alias'])
-main roalias.ReadOnlyAliasOracle
